OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sentenced for luring kidnap
OL,4,Avictim to house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been sentenced for
OL,7,Fpersuading a kidnap victim to visit her
OL,8,Fhouse where he was attacked by others.
OL,10,FLincoln Crown Court heard the man was
OL,11,Flured to Bethany Booth's home in Market
OL,12,FRasen because of personal matters
OL,13,Flinked to a previous relationship.
OL,15,FHe was held hostage and filmed as he
OL,16,Fwas repeatedly assaulted before being
OL,17,Fdriven to a property in Lincoln where
OL,18,Fhe escaped from a second floor window.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
