OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sentenced for luring kidnap
OL,4,Avictim to house
OL,5,
OL,6,FBooth, 36, formerly of Roman Fields in
OL,7,FMarket Rasen, admitted a charge of
OL,8,Ffalse imprisonment and was sentenced to
OL,9,Ftwo years in jail, suspended for two
OL,10,Fyears.
